-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1074 (F2): a HENCE after the LEST on a nested rule's first
-- line is that rule's, and is refused naming it.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF Seller, Buyer
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF delivery, payment

c MEANS
  PARTY Seller
  MUST delivery
  HENCE PARTY Buyer MUST payment LEST BREACH BY Buyer HENCE FULFILLED
